  "details": "1. go into your settings\n\n2. Scroll down to Tracking & IK\n\n3. Find Allow Head and Wrist VR Tracking Data \n\n4. when you try to turn that button on, it gives me the prompt but it won't turn on. It's mostly affect slime Tracking users, and any 3 party Full Body Tracking Parties.\n\n5. When you're on pc or just Standalone quest you still cannot turn it on. I have left evidence to prove pc and stand alone is affected.",
